{"curationManifestSha256":"8deda35e2cb9b2aae68a6d4e2614684605ec85d50bf2ff9dddd19f7e4588283b","curationVersion":"2026-07-30.2","lessonId":"lesson-1717-p2","main":{"annotations":[{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"选自《朱自清全集》第一卷（江苏教育出版社1996年版）。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11152-1"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"满月：圆月。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11152-2"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"闰儿：指作者的次子朱闰生。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11152-3"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"蓊（wěng）蓊郁郁：形容树木茂盛的样子。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11152-4"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"弥望：充满视野，满眼。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11152-5"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"田田：形容荷叶相连的样子。汉乐府《江南》中有“莲叶何田田”的句子。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11152-6"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"袅娜：柔美的样子。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11152-7"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"宛然：仿佛。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11152-8"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"脉（mò）脉：默默，这里形容水没有声音。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11152-9"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"风致：美的姿态。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11152-10"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"梵婀（ē）玲：英语violin的音译，即小提琴。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11152-11"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"一例：一概，一律。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11152-12"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"艳歌：专门咏唱男女爱情的歌曲。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11152-13"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"风流：这里指年轻男女不拘礼法地表露自己的爱情。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11152-14"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"梁元帝：南朝梁代皇帝萧绎（508—554）。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11152-15"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"妖童媛（yuàn）女，荡舟心许：艳丽的少男和美貌的少女，摇着小船互相默默地传情。妖，艳丽。心许，默许。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11152-16"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"鹢（yì）首徐回，兼传羽杯：船慢慢地来回摇荡着，双方传递着酒杯。鹢首，古时画鹢于船头，所以把船头叫“鹢首”。鹢，水鸟。兼，指双方。羽杯，酒器。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11152-17"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"棹（zhào）将移而藻挂，船欲动而萍开：桨要划动，却被水草挂着；船要移动，就把浮萍分开了。棹，船桨。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11152-18"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"尔其纤腰束素，迁延顾步：那细细的腰肢，裹着洁白的绸子，走走停停，不住地回视自己的动作。尔其，那。顾，回头看。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11152-19"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"敛裾：提着衣襟。裾，衣襟。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11152-20"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"消受：享受。多用于否定式。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11152-21"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"《西洲曲》：南朝乐府诗，描写青年女子思念意中人的痛苦。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11152-22"}],"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"荷塘月色","type":"text"},{"label":"[1]","noteId":"footnote-11152-1","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"\n\n朱自清","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"这几天心里颇不宁静。今晚在院子里坐着乘凉，忽然想起日日走过的荷塘，在这满月","type":"text"},{"label":"[2]","noteId":"footnote-11152-2","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"的光里，总该另有一番样子吧。月亮渐渐地升高了，墙外马路上孩子们的欢笑，已经听不见了；妻在屋里拍着闰儿","type":"text"},{"label":"[3]","noteId":"footnote-11152-3","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，迷迷糊糊地哼着眠歌。我悄悄地披了大衫，带上门出去。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"沿着荷塘，是一条曲折的小煤屑路。这是一条幽僻的路；白天也少人走，夜晚更加寂寞。荷塘四面，长着许多树，蓊蓊郁郁","type":"text"},{"label":"[4]","noteId":"footnote-11152-4","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"的。路的一旁，是些杨柳，和一些不知道名字的树。没有月光的晚上，这路上阴森森的，有些怕人。今晚却很好，虽然月光也还是淡淡的。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"路上只我一个人，背着手踱着。这一片天地好像是我的；我也像超出了平常的自己，到了另一世界里。我爱热闹，也爱冷静；爱群居，也爱独处。像今晚上，一个人在这苍茫的月下，什么都可以想，什么都可以不想，便觉是个自由的人。白天里一定要做的事，一定要说的话，现在都可不理。这是独处的妙处，我且受用这无边的荷香月色好了。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"曲曲折折的荷塘上面，弥望","type":"text"},{"label":"[5]","noteId":"footnote-11152-5","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"的是田田","type":"text"},{"label":"[6]","noteId":"footnote-11152-6","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"的叶子。叶子出水很高，像亭亭的舞女的裙。层层的叶子中间，零星地点缀着些白花，有袅娜","type":"text"},{"label":"[7]","noteId":"footnote-11152-7","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"地开着的，有羞涩地打着朵儿的；正如一粒粒的明珠，又如碧天里的星星，又如刚出浴的美人。微风过处，送来缕缕清香，仿佛远处高楼上渺茫的歌声似的。这时候叶子与花也有一丝的颤动，像闪电般，霎时传过荷塘的那边去了。叶子本是肩并肩密密地挨着，这便宛然","type":"text"},{"label":"[8]","noteId":"footnote-11152-8","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"有了一道凝碧的波痕。叶子底下是脉脉","type":"text"},{"label":"[9]","noteId":"footnote-11152-9","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"的流水，遮住了，不能见一些颜色；而叶子却更见风致","type":"text"},{"label":"[10]","noteId":"footnote-11152-10","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"了。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"月光如流水一般，静静地泻在这一片叶子和花上。薄薄的青雾浮起在荷塘里。叶子和花仿佛在牛乳中洗过一样，又像笼着轻纱的梦。虽然是满月，天上却有一层淡淡的云，所以不能朗照；但我以为这恰是到了好处——酣眠固不可少，小睡也别有风味的。月光是隔了树照过来的，高处丛生的灌木，落下参差的斑驳的黑影，峭楞楞如鬼一般；弯弯的杨柳的稀疏的倩影，却又像是画在荷叶上。塘中的月色并不均匀；但光与影有着和谐的旋律，如梵婀玲","type":"text"},{"label":"[11]","noteId":"footnote-11152-11","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"上奏着的名曲。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"荷塘的四面，远远近近，高高低低都是树，而杨柳最多。这些树将一片荷塘重重围住；只在小路一旁，漏着几段空隙，像是特为月光留下的。树色一例","type":"text"},{"label":"[12]","noteId":"footnote-11152-12","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"是阴阴的，乍看像一团烟雾；但杨柳的丰姿，便在烟雾里也辨得出。树梢上隐隐约约的是一带远山，只有些大意罢了。树缝里也漏着一两点路灯光，没精打采的，是渴睡人的眼。这时候最热闹的，要数树上的蝉声与水里的蛙声；但热闹是它们的，我什么也没有。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"忽然想起采莲的事情来了。采莲是江南的旧俗，似乎很早就有，而六朝时为盛；从诗歌里可以约略知道。采莲的是少年的女子，她们是荡着小船，唱着艳歌","type":"text"},{"label":"[13]","noteId":"footnote-11152-13","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"去的。采莲人不用说很多，还有看采莲的人。那是一个热闹的季节，也是一个风流","type":"text"},{"label":"[14]","noteId":"footnote-11152-14","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"的季节。梁元帝","type":"text"},{"label":"[15]","noteId":"footnote-11152-15","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"《采莲赋》里说得好：","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"“于是妖童媛女，荡舟心许","type":"text"},{"label":"[16]","noteId":"footnote-11152-16","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"；鹢首徐回，兼传羽杯","type":"text"},{"label":"[17]","noteId":"footnote-11152-17","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"；棹将移而藻挂，船欲动而萍开","type":"text"},{"label":"[18]","noteId":"footnote-11152-18","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。尔其纤腰束素，迁延顾步","type":"text"},{"label":"[19]","noteId":"footnote-11152-19","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"；夏始春余，叶嫩花初，恐沾裳而浅笑，畏倾船而敛裾","type":"text"},{"label":"[20]","noteId":"footnote-11152-20","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。”","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"可见当时嬉游的光景了。这真是有趣的事，可惜我们现在早已无福消受","type":"text"},{"label":"[21]","noteId":"footnote-11152-21","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"了。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"于是又记起《西洲曲》","type":"text"},{"label":"[22]","noteId":"footnote-11152-22","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"里的句子：","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"“采莲南塘秋，莲花过人头；低头弄莲子，莲子清如水。”","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"今晚若有采莲人，这儿的莲花也算得“过人头”了；只不见一些流水的影子，是不行的。这令我到底惦着江南了。——这样想着，猛一抬头，不觉已是自己的门前；轻轻地推门进去，什么声息也没有，妻已睡熟好久了。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"1927年7月，北京清华园","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"frontMatter":[],"guidance":[],"links":[],"media":[],"sourceOnlyBlocks":[],"sourcePostId":"11152-2","sourcePostNumber":1},"mediaReceiptLedgerSha256":"0319bd9f7623eb57ee396cafc0343cb6c4dc51dce258109a19edbdddd91be71c","mediaReceiptLedgerVersion":"2026-08-09.1","provenance":{"links":[{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11152-1","postId":"11152-2","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11152-1","text":"[1]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11152-2","postId":"11152-2","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11152-2","text":"[2]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11152-3","postId":"11152-2","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11152-3","text":"[3]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11152-4","postId":"11152-2","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11152-4","text":"[4]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11152-5","postId":"11152-2","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11152-5","text":"[5]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11152-6","postId":"11152-2","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11152-6","text":"[6]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11152-7","postId":"11152-2","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11152-7","text":"[7]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11152-8","postId":"11152-2","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11152-8","text":"[8]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11152-9","postId":"11152-2","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11152-9","text":"[9]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11152-10","postId":"11152-2","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11152-10","text":"[10]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11152-11","postId":"11152-2","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11152-11","text":"[11]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11152-12","postId":"11152-2","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11152-12","text":"[12]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11152-13","postId":"11152-2","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11152-13","text":"[13]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11152-14","postId":"11152-2","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11152-14","text":"[14]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11152-15","postId":"11152-2","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11152-15","text":"[15]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11152-16","postId":"11152-2","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11152-16","text":"[16]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11152-17","postId":"11152-2","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11152-17","text":"[17]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11152-18","postId":"11152-2","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11152-18","text":"[18]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11152-19","postId":"11152-2","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11152-19","text":"[19]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11152-20","postId":"11152-2","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11152-20","text":"[20]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11152-21","postId":"11152-2","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11152-21","text":"[21]","title":null},{"disposition